{title: The Blessing (FJ_205_en)}
{song_number: 205}
{language: en}
{key: G}
{tempo: 70}

[G]The Lord bless you [C]and keep you,
[G]make His face shine upon you [Dsus4]and be gracious to you.
[Em7]The Lord turn His [C]face toward you [G]and give you [Dsus4]peace.

{start_of_chorus}
[Em7]Amen, [C]Amen, [G]Amen. [Dsus4]
[Em7]Amen, [C]Amen, [G]Amen. [Dsus4]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge}
[Dsus4]May His favor be upon you [Em7]and a thousand generations
[C]and your family and your children and their [G]children and their children.
[Dsus4]May His presence go before you [Em7]and behind you and beside you,
[C]all around you and within you. [G]He is with you, He is with you.
[Dsus4]In the morning, in the [Em7]evening, in your coming and your going,
[C]in your weeping and rejoicing: [G]He is for you, He is for you.
[Dsus4]He is for you, He is for you. [Em7]He is for you, He is for you.
[C]He is for you, He is for you. [G]He is for [Dsus4]you.
{end_of_bridge}

{comment: Words and music: Kari Jobe, Cody Carnes, Steven Furtick and Chris Brown}
